\paragraph{RRF $k$-sensitivity.}
Table~\ref{tab:k_sensitivity} shows that calibration MAE and detection AUC are stable across $k \in \{10, 30, 60, 100, 200\}$, confirming that ContamCal is not sensitive to the RRF smoothing constant. \textbf{[PLACEHOLDER: exp-003]}

